src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.2ed8a5927d3ddd63:
Alfa Romeo Giulia 2021. godište stigla je kod nas u Beogradu na redovni servis. Nismo se ograničili samo na zamenu ulja: pregledali smo sve potrošne delove i istovremeno servisirali automatsku transmisiju.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili sveće;
- zamenili motorno ulje;
- zamenili uljni filter;
- zamenili vazdušni filter;
- zamenili filter kabine;
- potpuno zamenili dno automatske transmisije;
- zamenili ulje u automatskoj transmisiji **ZF 8HP**.

Posebno smo se posvetili transmisiji. Na automatskim menjačima **ZF 8HP** stanje ulja i dna treba redovno pratiti i ne odlagati servis: transmisija koja se redovno održava košta znatno manje od popravljene.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.e56766c48bb91541:
The 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia came to us in Belgrade for its scheduled maintenance. We didn’t stop at just an oil change; we reviewed all consumables and serviced the automatic transmission at the same time.

What we did:

- replaced the spark plugs;
- replaced the engine oil;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the air filter;
- replaced the cabin filter;
- completely replaced the transmission pan;
- replaced the oil in the ZF 8HP automatic transmission.

We dedicated extra attention to the transmission. For **ZF 8HP** automatics, it's important to monitor the state of the oil and the pan, and not to delay servicing: a well-maintained transmission is significantly cheaper to keep up than to repair.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.1476daa1cb3181c0:
**Audi Q7 2008. Opsežan popis radova u našoj autoservisu u Beogradu, Srbija.**

U naš servis je stigla Audi Q7 2008. godine sa impresivnim spiskom kvarova. Automobil je zahtevao ozbiljnu pažnju kako na delu oslanjanja, tako i na motoru.

Šta je urađeno:

- zamena opruga oslanjanja;
- zamena kočionih diskova i obloge;
- radovi na razvodu motora;
- ponovno brtvljenje usisnog sistema;
- zamena EGR cevi;
- mali tehnički pregled uz zamenu ulja i filtera.

Poseban problem je bio povezan sa stalnim curenjem motornog ulja. Nakon prethodnog servisa, drenažna čepka je bila postavljena pogrešno, pa je ulje neprekidno kapalo iz motora. Problem je rešen, sve je dovedeno u red.

Audi Q7 prve generacije zahteva stručno održavanje, posebno na starijim vozilima sa velikim pređenim kilometrima: važno je razjasniti uzrok kvara i otkloniti problem, a ne samo zameniti deo.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.4e58dd9d347eb723:
**2008 Audi Q7. Extensive list of services at our car service in Belgrade, Serbia.**

We received a 2008 Audi Q7 with a significant list of issues. The vehicle needed serious attention both in terms of the suspension and the engine.

What was done:

- suspension arm replacement;
- brake disc and pad replacement;
- engine alignment work;
- intake system resealing;
- EGR tube replacement;
- minor maintenance including oil and filter changes.

An additional problem involved a persistent engine oil leak. During previous servicing, the drain plug was improperly installed, causing oil to continuously drip from the engine. We resolved the issue and corrected everything.

The first-generation Audi Q7 requires careful maintenance, especially for older vehicles with high mileage: it is important to understand the root cause of the malfunction and address it, rather than just replacing the part.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.6c8bbf4e3f96c88a:
The Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 came to our car service in Belgrade for a minor service.

We completed the following:

- oil change;
- oil filter replacement;
- engine air filter replacement;
- cabin filter replacement;
- all brake pad replacements;
- brake system maintenance and inspection.

A note about the brakes. Brake pads are one of the key safety components, and it's essential to check them regularly. When replacing the pads, we always inspect **the discs, calipers, and guide pins**: if any of these parts are corroded or worn, the car will brake unevenly.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.cf30f1bc554af19c:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 je došao u naš servis u Beogradu na malo održavanje.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu uljnog filtera;
- zamenu vazdušnog filtera motora;
- zamenu filtera kabine;
- zamenu svih kočionih obloga;
- održavanje i proveru kočionog sistema.

Posebno o kočnicama. Obloge su jedan od ključnih elemenata bezbednosti, i potrebno ih je redovno proveravati. Kada menjamo obloge, uvek gledamo i **diskove, čeljusti i vođice**: ako je nešto od toga zarđalo ili istrošeno, kočenje vozila će biti nerazmjerno.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.596ba06341d6d94e:
The MINI Cooper SD with a **2.0 B47 diesel engine producing 170 hp** arrived at our car service in Belgrade for comprehensive maintenance.

We performed the following:

- oil change;
- replacement of all filters;
- replacement of the fuel filter;
- oil change in the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- computer diagnostics of the engine and electronic systems;
- intake system diagnostics.

The fuel filter on diesel engines should be replaced at least every **20,000 km**: this protects the fuel system and ensures smooth engine operation.

During the intake diagnostics, we found significant contamination: the swirl flaps were coated with soot and deposits, creating a thick layer. We suggested a cleaning to the owner, who agreed, and we completely cleaned the intake.

The B47 diesel engine in BMW and MINI, along with the Aisin automatic transmission and the intake system, appreciate regular maintenance: timely oil and filter changes and monitoring the condition of the intake make sure that expensive repairs are postponed for a long time.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.e8bcb915c90e3b28:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 ks** došao je u naš auto servis u Beogradu na kompleksno održavanje.

Urađeno je:

- zamena motornog ulja;
- zamena svih filtera;
- zamena dizel filtera;
- zamena ulja u 8-stepenom automatskom menjaču Aisin;
- kompjuterska dijagnostika motora i električnih sistema;
- dijagnostika usisnog sistema.

Dizel filter treba menjati najkasnije svake **20 000 km**: tako je zaštitljen sistem goriva, a motor radi stabilno.

Tokom dijagnostike usisa pronađeno je značajno zagađenje: vortex ventili su bili prekriveni čađom i naslagama, gustim „kaputom“. Predložili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on je pristao, i usis je potpuno očišćen.

Dizel B47 na BMW i MINI, automatski menjač Aisin i usisni sistem vole redovno održavanje: na vreme menjati ulje i filtere, obratiti pažnju na stanje usisa. Tako se skupi popravka odlaže na duže vreme.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.7f4a11abfe3f6d51:
U naš servis u Beogradu je stiglo vozilo sa pritužbom na **vibracije pri kočenju**: vozač pritisne papučicu i automobil počinje da se trese.

Počeli smo sa balansiranjem točkova — to je najčešći uzrok takvih vibracija, i najlakše ga je isključiti. Balansiranje je bilo u redu, pa smo nastavili sa kočionim sistemom.

Na prvi pogled, diskovi i pločice su izgledali u redu, bez očiglednih tragova ozbiljnog trošenja. Međutim, detaljnom proverom je utvrđeno da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. On je izazivao vibraciju.

P pokazali smo klijentu i dogovorili se oko popravke. Šta smo uradili:

- dijagnostika kočionog sistema;
- provera i balansiranje točkova;
- utvrđivanje deformacije levog kočionog diska;
- zamena kočionih diskova;
- zamena kočionih pločica;
- ponovna provera balansiranja točkova;
- probna vožnja nakon popravke.

Vibracija pri kočenju nakon ovoga je potpuno nestala, vozilo je provereno i vraćeno vlasniku.

Disk može izgledati normalno, a da pritom bude kriv — golim okom se takva deformacija ne može primetiti. Zato, ako se pojavi lupanje volana, vibracija papučice ili karoserije prilikom kočenja, dijagnostiku najbolje ne odlagati.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.c8b8f932a13e3ab3:
A vehicle arrived at our car service in Belgrade with a complaint of **vibration when braking**: the driver presses the pedal, and the car starts to shake.

We began with wheel balancing — this is the most common cause of such vibrations, and it’s the easiest to rule out. The balancing was found to be fine, so we continued checking the braking system.

Visually, the discs and pads appeared to be in good condition, with no obvious signs of significant wear. However, upon closer inspection, we discovered that the **left brake disc was deformed**. This was causing the vibration.

We showed the customer and agreed on the repairs. Here's what we did:

- braking system diagnostics;
- checking and balancing the wheels;
- identifying the deformation of the left brake disc;
- replacing the brake discs;
- replacing the brake pads;
- rechecking the wheel balancing;
- a test drive after the repairs.

After this, the vibration during braking completely disappeared, and the car was checked and returned to the owner.

A disc may look normal while still being warped — such deformation can’t be detected by eye. Therefore, if you experience steering wheel wobble, pedal vibration, or car body shaking when braking, it’s best not to delay the diagnostics.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.4ff8d2211b4eaa28:
The 2024 Peugeot 308 equipped with the **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came to our car service in Belgrade for a major service. We carried out a complete set of tasks:

- Timing belt replacement;
- Water pump replacement;
- Coolant replacement;
- Engine oil replacement;
- Filter replacements;
- Inspection and maintenance of all related components.

There is an important detail regarding the 1.5 BlueHDi engine that is worth noting: the camshaft drive chain. Early versions of this engine used a chain that was **7 mm** wide. Over time, this chain stretches, and in the worst-case scenario, it can break and take the engine with it.

When servicing these engines, it is recommended to install a reinforced **8 mm** chain, along with the camshaft bearings and the camshafts themselves. For the 2023-2024 Peugeot 308 models, the 8 mm chain comes factory-installed.

This means that during a major service, we need to inspect not only the timing belt but also the camshaft chain, as well as being aware of the specific known traits of the engine.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.9b5995496644cca8:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** došao je u našu rusku automehaničarsku radnju u Beogradu na veliki servis. Izvršili smo kompletan set radova:

- zamena zupčastog remena;
- zamena vodene pumpe;
- zamena antifriza;
- zamena motornog ulja;
- zamena filtera;
- provera i servis svih povezanih komponenti.

Kod motora 1.5 BlueHDi postoji jedna sitnica o kojoj treba imati posebnu pažnju: lanac za odvod bregaste osovine. U ranijim verzijama motora bio je lanac širine **7 mm**. Vremenom se istegne, a u najgorem slučaju može se slomiti što vodi do oštećenja motora.

Prilikom servisiranja ovakvih motora preporučuje se ugradnja pojačanog lanca **8 mm**, zajedno s ležajem bregaste osovine i samim bregastim osovinama. Na Peugeot 308 modelima iz 2023–2024. godine, fabrika već ugrađuje lanac od 8 mm.

To znači da na velikom servisu treba obratiti pažnju ne samo na zupčasti remen, već i na lanac bregaste osovine, kao i na poznate karakteristike konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.1f9ade85828c335e:
Seat Leon sa pređenih **190 000 km** dovezen je u našu auto-servis u Beogradu na veliko planirano održavanje, poznato kao veliko servisiranje.

Na ovoj kilometraži najbolje je odmah izvršiti servis na glavnim komponentama, pa smo uradili:

- zamenu kompleta rasplinjača GRA;
- zamenu vodene pumpe;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih potrebnih filtera;
- zamenu zadnjih amortizera;
- zamenu ulja u DSG DQ250 menjaču.

Za Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi, veliko servisiranje predstavlja osnovu održavanja. Rasplinjač, pumpa, tehničke tečnosti i potrošni materijal koji su zamenjeni na vreme, sprečavaju mnogo skuplje probleme u budućnosti.

Posebno o **DQ250**. Ovo je šestostepeni robot sa mokrim spojnicama, i transmisijsko ulje u njemu mora se menjati prema propisu — to je ključno za njegovu funkcionalnost.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.4b2a5ba7416d8106:
A Seat Leon with a mileage of **190,000 km** arrived at our Russian car service in Belgrade for a major scheduled maintenance, also known as a major service.

At this mileage, it’s best to address the key components all at once, so we performed the following:

- Replaced the timing belt kit;
- Replaced the water pump;
- Replaced the coolant;
- Changed the engine oil;
- Replaced all necessary filters;
- Replaced the rear shock absorbers;
- Flushed and replaced the oil in the DSG DQ250 gearbox.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda, and Audi, the major service is a crucial point of maintenance. Changing the timing belt, water pump, fluids, and consumables on time can prevent much more expensive issues down the line.

A note about the **DQ250**: This is a six-speed dual-clutch transmission with wet clutches, and the transmission oil must be replaced according to schedule — that’s how you keep the gearbox running smoothly.
